{"id":"611144cc6c6066b7","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-heyting-algebraic.md","title":"thm-heyting-algebraic","display":"thm-heyting-algebraic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-heyting]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"],"display":"thm-heyting-algebraic","label":"93-thm-heyting-algebraic","aliases":["93-thm-heyting-algebraic"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" href=\"?note=edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" title=\"93-df-heyting\">93-df-heyting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-heyting-algebraic"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-heyting-algebraic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-heyting-algebraic</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-heyting-algebraic-thm-heyting-algebraic\">thm-heyting-algebraic <code>thm-heyting-algebraic</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" href=\"?note=edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" title=\"93-df-heyting\">93-df-heyting</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H}\">\\(\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H}\\)</span> are the explicit Heyting-expansion constructors defined below; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Op}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Op}_{93}\\)</span> is the operation-family projection of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\n\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\rangle)\\vee^{\\mathbf B}b\\right\\rangle:\na,b\\in|\\mathbf B|\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\n\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\rangle)\\vee^{\\mathbf B}b\\right\\rangle:\na,b\\in|\\mathbf B|\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(\\wedge)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(\\vee)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(0)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(1)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(\\wedge)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(\\vee)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(0)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf B)(1)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H}\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf B|,\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H}\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf B|,\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Every Boolean algebra admits this canonical Heyting expansion; finiteness is unnecessary. The implication graph is new, while the meet, join, and two nullary operation graphs are copied through the sourced operation-family projection.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-heyting-algebraic-thm-heyting-algebraic","text":"thm-heyting-algebraic `thm-heyting-algebraic`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-heyting","status":"resolved","id":"edc4ffdba40ef7c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-heyting]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-heyting","status":"resolved","id":"edc4ffdba40ef7c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)$ and $\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-heyting]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}$, and $\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H}$ are the explicit Heyting-expansion constructors defined below; $\\operatorname{Op}_{93}$ is the operation-family projection of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolHeytOpFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf B^{\\mathsf H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Op}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolImp}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle,\n\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\ra